---
---

<section class="hero reveal">
  <h1>That’s a cool, simple password generator.</h1>
  <p class="hero__copy">
    I made this inspired by the wonderful <a
      class="hero__link"
      href="https://lastpass.com/features/password-generator"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noreferrer"
    >
      LastPass generator
    </a>.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    text-align: center;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem) 0;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 14ch;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 8vw, 5.8rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    color: var(--foreground);
    text-shadow: 0 8px 24px color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 12%, transparent);
    animation: fade-up 700ms ease-out both;
  }

  .hero__copy {
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 56ch;
    color: var(--muted-text);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.7vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    animation: fade-up 700ms ease-out 120ms both;
  }

  .hero__link {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .hero__link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.18em;
  }

  @keyframes fade-up {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(12px);
    }

    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
</style>
